    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This board game is a mahjong game played by 4 people or computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/0d612d556fb046beea5a75b2c614f420.avif?t=1738922814\" /></div>You can play with 3 ai users by yourself, Or you can play Mahjong with 3 other real users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game supports traditional [Chinese mahjong] and [Japanese riich mahjong].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/670e74459f1f999eceb2eb619198d1be.avif?t=1738922814\" /></div>Tutorials, practice( single play mode ), and online play ( 4 user play mode ) supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We provide two styles of mahjong tiles for western players unfamiliar with mahjong games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6You can learn how to play Mahjong by investing only 10 minutes in the tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/342d59751e7df669f1cfb0dce9bd8f6b.avif?t=1738922814\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game requires a network connection for online play. If the network connection is not smooth, the game will not play normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also supports single play game with AI players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Mahjong is a game that requires skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our games are played by thousands of real users every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30% of users have played this game more than 10,000 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll have to play that much and you'll be of average skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are in doubt about the game opponent, please report it using the replay function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game has in-app purchase items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can purchase 3, 5, 9, 30, or 50 gold items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/4eede5bf02f963f20d4d2691cbc58e3c.avif?t=1738922814\" data-has-big /></div>Purchased gold can be used to exchange for game money, avatars, and other items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many Mahjong players await your challenge.</p>",
